<title>PAPUA NEW GUINEA: RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIA BEAT PAPUA NEW GUINEA 52-6.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-AUSTRALIA BEAT PAPUA NEW GUINEA 52-6.</headline>
<dateline>PORT MORSEBY 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Papua New</p>
<p>Guinea 52-6 (halftime 28-6) in their international on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia - Tries: Rod Wishart (2), Wayne Bartrim (2),</p>
<p>Michael Buettner (2), Tim Brasher (2), Andrew Johns. Goals:</p>
<p>Johns (8).</p>
<p>Papua New Guinea - Try: Adrian Lam. Goal: Tuksy Karu.</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000</p>
</text>
